---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Support · Mental Note" active="support">
<div class="phead"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="eyebrow">Support</div>
  <h1>Keep this free.</h1>
  <p class="lead">We're a student-run project, not a business. Talks and donations pay for the site, the app, and the workshops we bring into schools.</p>
</div></div>
<div class="light"><div class="block" style="padding-top:48px"><div class="wrap rv">
  <div class="three">
    <div class="tcard paper lit tape"><h3>Donate</h3><p>Not open yet — we've applied for fiscal sponsorship and will turn this on once it's approved.</p><span>Soon</span></div>
    <div class="tcard paper lit tape"><h3>Book a talk</h3><p>The most useful thing a school can do. It funds us and reaches students at the same time.</p><span>Enquire →</span></div>
    <div class="tcard paper lit tape"><h3>Share it</h3><p>Free. Send the app to one person who'd use it.</p><span>Copy link →</span></div>
  </div>
  <dl class="qa" style="margin-top:56px">
    <div><dt>Where donations go</dt><dd>Hosting, the domain, workshop materials, and travel to schools. Neither founder takes a salary.</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Is it tax-deductible?</dt><dd>Not yet. We've applied for fiscal sponsorship; until it's approved we can't accept tax-deductible donations.</dd></div>
  </dl>
</div></div></div>
</Layout>
